DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The mmvvnneettaa driver provides support for the Ethernet controller on the
     Marvell ARMADA 37x, 38x and 37xx series SoCs.  Access to the MDIO bus is
     provided by the mmvvmmddiioo driver.  For more information on configuring this
     device, see ifconfig(8).

